WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.330
The story of Halacame from
a lot of lived experience.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.480
I was living with my family,

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.060
and I started to recollect
these memories

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.690
of, like, what it was like
to grow up in that household.

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:14.330
I think you need to be a little
more understanding about Mom.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:14.870
She's overprotective.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.240
The dynamic in my household
was not something I got
to see onscreen,

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.030
so I put all these little
script vignettes together

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.090
 and that was the basis
 ofHala.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.180
Because this is pretty much
Minh's story,

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.450
I knew that it would be
authentic,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.120
and it would be very powerful.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.870
I'm not sure why I write.
I've said everything
I want to say.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.420
There must be
something you wanna say
that nobody's already said.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.240
Hala doesn't quite have
it all together.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.060
She's still figuring it out.
She's gonna make mistakes.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:57.390
She's a teenage girl,
and we need to normalize that.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.180
-And you're not scared?
-Are you?

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.390
Maybe.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.210
Even though she's from
a Muslim family,

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:12.450
it is a movie that a lot
of people can relate to.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.600
I'm sorry.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:21.210
For young women, in particular,
it's important to feel like

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.030
you can have your own agency

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.480
and go on the search
for identity

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.720
without having to abandon
your culture or your faith.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.660
You said that I could tell you
if something was going on.

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:33.180
Something's going on.

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:35.420
We might have cultural
differences,

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.030
but in actuality,

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.330
there are more things
that make us similar 
than different. 

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.420
And this movie is really
a beautiful example of that.

